            "heading": "Enable Seamless Multilingual Collaboration",
            "text": "<p>10 people. 5 languages. One seamless conversation. In a group discussion, up to 10 participants can speak at the same time, each in their own language. X1 Meeting translates 5 languages instantly — everyone hears the conversation in their preferred language. No one waits for a turn. Teamwork flows without interruption.</p>"
