            "heading": "Launch Meetings in 10 Seconds, No Setup Required",
            "text": "<p>Zero friction. Zero setup. Zero wait. Start a multilingual meeting instantly — just share a QR code or meeting ID. No IT, no app downloads, no account registration. X1 Meeting works right out of the box. Perfect for spontaneous team talks or last-minute client calls.</p>"
