            "heading": "Join from Any Device, Anywhere",
            "text": "<p>Participants Join via Their Own Devices Participants use their own laptop, tablet, or smartphone — no proprietary hardware needed. Remote employees, clients, and partners simply click a link and get live translation on their preferred device. Work happens where they are.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b3": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pp-x1-883c1de3e0.jpg",
            "heading": "Live Subtitles for Assemblies",
            "text": "<p>One speaker. Four languages. Every attendee chooses their own. During large events like assemblies, seminars, or parent-teacher meetings, one spoken language is simultaneously translated into 4 languages. Each person chooses their preferred language on their own device — reading live subtitles and listening via personal earphones. Everyone stays informed and included.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b4": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pp-x1-aeb7fe848f.png",
            "heading": "Instant Transcripts & Smart Meeting Minutes",
            "text": "<p>Auto‑transcribed. Speaker‑labeled. Exportable in one click. Every word is captured live — with speaker identification and automatic transcription. No more frantic note-taking. The X1 Meeting turns conversations into clear, searchable minutes that you can export securely in one click. Focus on the discussion, not the paperwork.</p>"
