            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pp-x1-aa93d1d86b.png",
            "heading": "Bone Conduction – Clear Voice in Any Noise",
            "text": "<p>Your voice, isolated. Background noise, ignored. In bustling open offices, busy trade shows, or noisy classrooms, X1 Meeting uses advanced bone conduction technology to pick up only your voice – not the chaos around you. Delivers 90% accuracy even at 75dB, and 30% improvement over the previous generation at 80dB. Your words always get through.</p>"
