        },
        "b1": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pp-x1-04dbacbe2c.jpg",
            "heading": "AI Large Model – Understands Context, Corrects on the Fly",
            "text": "<p>Natural, accurate translation – even with business jargon. X1 Meeting’s built‑in AI doesn’t just translate words – it understands the flow of conversation. It automatically corrects errors and adapts to specialized terminology, whether you're discussing KPIs, ROI, legal clauses, or academic research. The result? Translations that sound natural, fluent, and precisely on point.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b2": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pp-x1-5251e0334f.jpg",
            "heading": "Enterprise‑Grade Privacy – Fully Compliant & Encrypted",
            "text": "<p>GDPR · CCPA · HIPAA · FERPA – your data is always protected. X1 Meeting meets strict global privacy standards. All translation conversations are end‑to‑end encrypted and never shared. Whether you're an HR manager, legal team, healthcare professional, or educator – use with confidence, knowing sensitive information stays completely private.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b3": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/pp-x1-5d116f6657.jpg",
            "heading": "150+ Global Servers – Fast, Stable, Secure Anywhere",
            "text": "<p>Encrypted high-speed translation, no matter where you are. With over 150 local servers worldwide, X1 Meeting creates an encrypted high-speed channel for your translations. Whether you're in a downtown HQ, a remote branch office, a suburban campus, or traveling internationally – expect fast, stable, and secure performance every time.</p>"
